loxilb-inference-gateway is a fork of the LoxiLB project. It adds
inference-aware L4/L7 load balancing for LLM serving fleets (vLLM, SGLang) on
top of LoxiLB's GoLang/eBPF data path. With no AI capability enabled it behaves
as an unmodified LoxiLB load balancer.

